{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123191","id":4443599541,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCNvytQ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123191","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123191.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123191.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123191","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123191/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123191/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123191/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/8817dfcfc2b5b29052adc77ea3d2209b86646a1c","number":123191,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Emit `changed` when `TileMapLayer` cells have been changed","user":{"login":"GiacomoPope","id":44242839,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MjQyODM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44242839?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope","html_url":"https://github.com/GiacomoPope","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThis PR offers a solution to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107342 which discusses the lack of a signal emitted when the `TileMapLayer`. Now, when cells are changed (for example when the user paints them in using the `TileMapLayer` editor, a signal is emitted. This issue was discovered during a conversation in the proposal https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15480.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nIn the proposal and in the linked issue, another option was put forward for a `tiles_painted` or `tiles_changed` signal, but this was met with some resistance in the proposal. I would be happy to modify this PR to use a second signal if this was deemed appropriate. \r\n\r\nLooking at the documentation, the change signal states:\r\n\r\n> Emitted when this TileMapLayer's properties changes. This includes modified cells, properties, or changes made to its assigned [TileSet](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_tileset.html#class-tileset).\r\n\r\nPersonally, it's not obvious whether this means `changed` is signalled when cells are modified on the `TileMapLayer` or when cells of the `TileSet` are modified. In the proposal, the opinion of others was that `changed` is supposed to be about the `TileMapLayer` node itself.\r\n\r\nPersonally, it's unclear exactly whether `changed` should be emitted, but I do think having a signal for this form of change is interestin, for example when building tool scripts and plug ins and should be available in some way.\r\n\r\nMy current solution is to set a dirty flag when a cell is set and then then if this flag is true, I emit the signal `changed` within the `_internal_update()` of the `TileMapLayer`.\r\n\r\nI have tested this locally and it doesnt seem to be too noisy of an option but maybe someone more experienced will suggest a different placement for this emission.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-09-04T14:41:00Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T15:23:28Z","closed_at":"2026-09-04T15:22:25Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"9e5ba0bdf37688e4abf8ca6172603bc7f66d32cd","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"GiacomoPope:tilemaplayer_signal_change_when_tiles_changed","ref":"tilemaplayer_signal_change_when_tiles_changed","repo":{"id":1353782127,"node_id":"R_kgDOULETbw","name":"godot","full_name":"GiacomoPope/godot","owner":{"login":"GiacomoPope","id":44242839,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MjQyODM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44242839?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope","html_url":"https://github.com/GiacomoPope","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GiacomoPope/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"htt